  "root_problem": "CRM dispute ticket volume roughly doubled from ~600/month (Jun-Jul 2026) to ~1200-1260/month (Aug-Sep 2026) (E-02), and billing-import validation rule BV-17 — deployed 2026-08-01, comparing raw AMI register values against 12-month m3 consumption history with no unit conversion (E-13) — erroneously rejects valid high-consumption reads from firmware-v4.2 meters, which report in 0.1 m3 units (E-14), as REJECTED_HIGH_CONSUMPTION, driving estimate substitution for 1184 of the 1240 ESTIMATED disputed bills (E-12). This confirmed mechanism explains at least the ESTIMATED minority (41%, E-04) of the Aug-Sep dispute surge."
